tornado-hyperlink

This crate is a vendored copy of `hyperrat` v0.1.3 (an OSC 8 hyperlink
widget for the `ratatui` ecosystem), with one path-only migration: the
upstream crate used `ratatui_core` 0.1.x (the unstable split of
`ratatui` 0.29); in this fork the equivalent surface is taken directly
from `ratatui` 0.30, which has absorbed `ratatui_core`. All behaviour,
public API, semantics, and tests are unchanged.

